        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-23T22:13:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't know how I missed this post, but I'd love to do something like this.<br><br>Would there ba any place we could have set up for 24 hour play? &nbsp;I think it would be super cool if we could have games going, try to get teams of three to come play for blocks of time and then if there are more people that want to play they can jump in and get us 4&amp;5 player teams.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would spend a lot of my free hours (what little I will have) playing in such an event.</p>",
