      {
        "id": 197200,
        "name": "RySmith6",
        "username": "RySmith6",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/{size}/1852_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-26T01:44:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks Paul! We'll try to gauge interest sooner rather than later.</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1POF0w-j_IYkYbdM2lTvGO7uexgeYclviERaP5DiBB6k/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">I started a sheet to try to organize games!</a>&nbsp;Combination signup/timeline organization sheet, really, as I'm fairly fuzzy on precisely when each of the fights happen, other than (mostly) the expansion release order.</p><p>There are a few things we can all decide together: 1) How canonical we want to get with \"when\" heroes are available to be used(i.e. Parse available only after Cosmic Omnitron?); 2) If/where the alternate-timeline fights go; 3) how we distribute the team villains fights.</p><p>I think 1 would be interesting to be pretty strict, but it's probably simpler to open up the roster from the start.</p><p>Also, I would love to do advanced/challenge matches, but I'm hoping regular villains will go smoothly enough this year so we can try bigger, badder villains at other events in the future.</p>",
